(5507810, 795395, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice still life.</td>', 'Nice still life.', '2009-06-01 05:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507811, 794873, 35602, '<td valign="top">Now that is definitely unusual.  Have never seen one of these.  Issues with lots of uneven graining.  Not sure if it is too slow a shutter speed or too high an iso.  Focus is great on the serrated teeth.</td>', 'Now that is definitely unusual.  Have never seen one of these.  Issues with lots of uneven graining.  Not sure if it is too slow a shutter speed or too high an iso.  Focus is great on the serrated teeth.', '2009-06-01 05:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507812, 795453, 35602, '<td valign="top">Way too much noise on this.  Must have been a very uneven exposure.  You must have tried to compensate by adjusting shadows so much that they created nothing but blots of color all over the picture.  Perhaps compensating exposure would have been better, though the background would have been white out.  Change subject direction as well to create a more even lighting.</td>', 'Way too much noise on this.  Must have been a very uneven exposure.  You must have tried to compensate by adjusting shadows so much that they created nothing but blots of color all over the picture.  Perhaps compensating exposure would have been better, though the background would have been white out.  Change subject direction as well to create a more even lighting.', '2009-06-01 05:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
