(5511843, 795454, 80908, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different, but the varying backgrounds on the left is offputting to me, as are the splashes of green. Perhaps this could have worked as a B&amp;W?</td>', 'Interesting and different, but the varying backgrounds on the left is offputting to me, as are the splashes of green. Perhaps this could have worked as a B&W?', '2009-06-03 09:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
