(5515665, 795621, 83313, '<td valign="top">I figured it was some sort of firemans tool, but I had to go find Firequip on the net to find out what this was for. Certainly fits the challenge nicely, and a way better pic of it than anything on their site.</td>', 'I figured it was some sort of firemans tool, but I had to go find Firequip on the net to find out what this was for. Certainly fits the challenge nicely, and a way better pic of it than anything on their site.', '2009-06-05 14:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
