(5515672, 795651, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like the ceiling light in your bathroom. At least I <b>think</b> that is a shower curtain rod...<br/> <br/>An common item photographed in an unusual way. Kudos for the creativity on this one.</td>', 'Looks like the ceiling light in your bathroom. At least I think that is a shower curtain rod... An common item photographed in an unusual way. Kudos for the creativity on this one.', '2009-06-05 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
