(5515682, 795484, 83313, '<td valign="top">Since I am not a flower person, I don''t know what is unusual about this. Perhaps the part that seems shaped like a bird?</td>', 'Since I am not a flower person, I don''t know what is unusual about this. Perhaps the part that seems shaped like a bird?', '2009-06-05 14:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
