(5516068, 795556, 100831, '<td valign="top">Well Lydia, great color and a nice background. And I''m sure it''s unusual. But is it an object?</td>', 'Well Lydia, great color and a nice background. And I''m sure it''s unusual. But is it an object?', '2009-06-05 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516073, 795484, 63244, '<td valign="top">i love the beauty and the abstractness of this shot. If could be imaged as a beautiful bird with it''s tail forward, not just as the center of a flower. I love the detail and the colors. Nicely done!</td>', 'i love the beauty and the abstractness of this shot. If could be imaged as a beautiful bird with it''s tail forward, not just as the center of a flower. I love the detail and the colors. Nicely done!', '2009-06-05 20:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516075, 795324, 63244, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this! The perspective and the crop is amazing. The subdued colors are great in my opinion..no, they are refreshing!!! All the lines and spheres make this very interesting. Well done!</td>', 'I absolutely love this! The perspective and the crop is amazing. The subdued colors are great in my opinion..no, they are refreshing!!! All the lines and spheres make this very interesting. Well done!', '2009-06-05 20:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516076, 794745, 63244, '<td valign="top">I love what you''ve done with your patio!! :P The colors are great here, but the focus appears just a touch soft. I like the shapes and the movement.</td>', 'I love what you''ve done with your patio!! :P The colors are great here, but the focus appears just a touch soft. I like the shapes and the movement.', '2009-06-05 20:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516083, 794390, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. I like the border treatment on this shot. It is simple and elegant. Really like this a lot.</td>', 'This is interesting. I like the border treatment on this shot. It is simple and elegant. Really like this a lot.', '2009-06-05 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516285, 795101, 96530, '<td valign="top">Cute little bugger- I hear a burp coming...</td>', 'Cute little bugger- I hear a burp coming...', '2009-06-06 01:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516330, 794450, 18197, '<td valign="top">Certainly a rarely photographed subject. An unusual angle creating cone-head helmets ... a certain amount of poetic justice there I think. I like it and am giving it best in show. Well done.</td>', 'Certainly a rarely photographed subject. An unusual angle creating cone-head helmets ... a certain amount of poetic justice there I think. I like it and am giving it best in show. Well done.', '2009-06-06 02:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516333, 795134, 18197, '<td valign="top">There is another photo of the same subject from the same angle at roughly the same time. Both very very good. Both meet the challenge. And both are indicative of how different photogs will capture and edit a scene differently. Both of you get a 9.</td>', 'There is another photo of the same subject from the same angle at roughly the same time. Both very very good. Both meet the challenge. And both are indicative of how different photogs will capture and edit a scene differently. Both of you get a 9.', '2009-06-06 02:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516334, 794377, 18197, '<td valign="top">There is another photo of the same subject from the same angle at roughly the same time. Both very very good. Both meet the challenge. And both are indicative of how different photogs will capture and edit a scene differently. Both of you get a 9.</td>', 'There is another photo of the same subject from the same angle at roughly the same time. Both very very good. Both meet the challenge. And both are indicative of how different photogs will capture and edit a scene differently. Both of you get a 9.', '2009-06-06 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516336, 795053, 18197, '<td valign="top">How interesting and fun. I like the red mood of this!</td>', 'How interesting and fun. I like the red mood of this!', '2009-06-06 02:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516338, 795636, 18197, '<td valign="top">To be honest, there was a "10" in this photo struggling to get out. I like the subject, the lighting, the POV. You captured it brilliantly. And then you ran smack dab into one of my pet peeves - tilted photos. And the funny thing is ... it''s probably better tilted just a little ... so well done. I''ll set aside my bias on this one!</td>', 'To be honest, there was a "10" in this photo struggling to get out. I like the subject, the lighting, the POV. You captured it brilliantly. And then you ran smack dab into one of my pet peeves - tilted photos. And the funny thing is ... it''s probably better tilted just a little ... so well done. I''ll set aside my bias on this one!', '2009-06-06 02:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516340, 795119, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. I love that this is B&amp;W. I love the texture. I love the composition ... and the execution generally. Among the best in the challenge. Well done!</td>', 'Brilliant. I love that this is B&W. I love the texture. I love the composition ... and the execution generally. Among the best in the challenge. Well done!', '2009-06-06 02:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516342, 795068, 18197, '<td valign="top">This works on so many levels ... Brilliant photo.</td>', 'This works on so many levels ... Brilliant photo.', '2009-06-06 02:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516344, 795174, 18197, '<td valign="top">Would love to stand where you stood and explore this. Thanks for showing it to us.<br/> <br/>Where is it btw?</td>', 'Would love to stand where you stood and explore this. Thanks for showing it to us. Where is it btw?', '2009-06-06 02:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516665, 795161, 63244, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this just cracks me up, lol! Your subtle dof works very well to draw the attention to the pigs face and not the candy. I like the lighting you used. Side light is nice on this. This is advanced editing, so I''m going to bring up your sensor dust spots!!!!!  :0  Should have cloned those babies out! :) I think this is a cute and creative shot!<br/> <br/>Edited for poor typing...ugh!</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this just cracks me up, lol! Your subtle dof works very well to draw the attention to the pigs face and not the candy. I like the lighting you used. Side light is nice on this. This is advanced editing, so I''m going to bring up your sensor dust spots!!!!!  :0  Should have cloned those babies out! :) I think this is a cute and creative shot! Edited for poor typing...ugh!', '2009-06-06 11:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516670, 795631, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. I love the sharpness of all the details, the textures...great crop also. Monochrome works very well with this. A touch deeper depth of field might have made this almost perfect. (There is a bit of fuzziness on the middle front of the dandelion center (or whatever this is).<br/> <br/>Edited for typo!</td>', 'This is just beautiful. I love the sharpness of all the details, the textures...great crop also. Monochrome works very well with this. A touch deeper depth of field might have made this almost perfect. (There is a bit of fuzziness on the middle front of the dandelion center (or whatever this is). Edited for typo!', '2009-06-06 11:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516676, 795101, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is just darling. Such a precious little thing. I like the very subtle lighting and that only it''s nose and a little bit of the face are in the light. Nice choice on DOF.</td>', 'This is just darling. Such a precious little thing. I like the very subtle lighting and that only it''s nose and a little bit of the face are in the light. Nice choice on DOF.', '2009-06-06 11:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516794, 795594, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the textures, colors, and DOF. And your object is quite unusual!</td>', 'I like the textures, colors, and DOF. And your object is quite unusual!', '2009-06-06 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516798, 795108, 66384, '<td valign="top">Pretty light and tone. And I like your composition.</td>', 'Pretty light and tone. And I like your composition.', '2009-06-06 12:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516800, 795415, 66384, '<td valign="top">And I have the sewing machine to go with it. :)</td>', 'And I have the sewing machine to go with it. :)', '2009-06-06 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516801, 795453, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the noise in this shot. But the two faces are amusing.</td>', 'I don''t care for the noise in this shot. But the two faces are amusing.', '2009-06-06 12:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
