(5516805, 795357, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool engineering! I''m not sure if I like the shadows. They are okay, but the image might be better without them.</td>', 'Cool engineering! I''m not sure if I like the shadows. They are okay, but the image might be better without them.', '2009-06-06 12:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516808, 795341, 66384, '<td valign="top">Probably be quite useful on a bitter cold day. I wonder why the white hair? Anyway, nicely photographed. I like the textures.</td>', 'Probably be quite useful on a bitter cold day. I wonder why the white hair? Anyway, nicely photographed. I like the textures.', '2009-06-06 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516811, 793808, 66384, '<td valign="top">Must be Michigan UP. All the mailboxes are like that there -- well not quite that high maybe. I like the shot.</td>', 'Must be Michigan UP. All the mailboxes are like that there -- well not quite that high maybe. I like the shot.', '2009-06-06 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516812, 795621, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image with very nice lighting. I wonder how that tool is used?</td>', 'Nice simple image with very nice lighting. I wonder how that tool is used?', '2009-06-06 12:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516816, 795608, 66384, '<td valign="top">Pretty bokeh and nice abstract.</td>', 'Pretty bokeh and nice abstract.', '2009-06-06 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516820, 795500, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting object -- very. I think it''s well photographed, but I think a different background would enhance this image. The texture and color in this blue background are distracting, and don''t complement the object.</td>', 'Interesting object -- very. I think it''s well photographed, but I think a different background would enhance this image. The texture and color in this blue background are distracting, and don''t complement the object.', '2009-06-06 12:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516825, 794450, 66384, '<td valign="top">Whoa, that''s a lot of instruments.</td>', 'Whoa, that''s a lot of instruments.', '2009-06-06 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516828, 795134, 66384, '<td valign="top">That is unusual. The modern building looks like a parasite growing on the classic building.I like the star lights. Did you use a star filter?</td>', 'That is unusual. The modern building looks like a parasite growing on the classic building.I like the star lights. Did you use a star filter?', '2009-06-06 12:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516831, 794407, 66384, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile. The bird in the center looks surprised to see the headless one on the right.</td>', 'Makes me smile. The bird in the center looks surprised to see the headless one on the right.', '2009-06-06 12:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516832, 795180, 66384, '<td valign="top">OMG, I took a shot just like this last month. It was the first time I had seen one of these cones. I like the way the green radiates out from the center.</td>', 'OMG, I took a shot just like this last month. It was the first time I had seen one of these cones. I like the way the green radiates out from the center.', '2009-06-06 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516835, 795544, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very cool clarity on that bubble. I like the colors.</td>', 'Very cool clarity on that bubble. I like the colors.', '2009-06-06 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516836, 795532, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2009-06-06 12:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516839, 794951, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit.</td>', 'Beautifully lit.', '2009-06-06 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5516842, 794930, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool capture.</td>', 'Cool capture.', '2009-06-06 13:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
