(5519977, 795185, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fun hair-do and odd pose. Too bad the focus didn''t come out sharper. <br/> <br/>I have a lot of trouble getting tack sharp focus with my 70-300 lens too, unless I use a tripod. I am disappointed in the image stabilization, because wildlife is why I bought the lens, and I don''t use a tripod for that. However my top rated photo, with a yellow ribbon, was taken with that lens using a tripod, so it is capable of good things.</td>', 'Fun hair-do and odd pose. Too bad the focus didn''t come out sharper.  I have a lot of trouble getting tack sharp focus with my 70-300 lens too, unless I use a tripod. I am disappointed in the image stabilization, because wildlife is why I bought the lens, and I don''t use a tripod for that. However my top rated photo, with a yellow ribbon, was taken with that lens using a tripod, so it is capable of good things.', '2009-06-08 12:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
