(5520021, 795068, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on your HM, Brent!   How odd about the scores.  I guess they give it to the person who got their image uploaded first?  Surely there''s a protocol for this odd occurance...  Seems like you should share the ribbon if you both qualififed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The scores are calculated to more decimal places than the 4 they show us, and that''s how ties are broken. Lovely shot, truly unusual object. Personally, I''d have thought this *should* be a ribbon, but...<br/> <br/>ETA:<br/> <br/>Wowza! An honest-to-God ribbon tie! Congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-09 00:01:17.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Congrats on your HM, Brent!   How odd about the scores.  I guess they give it to the person who got their image uploaded first?  Surely there''s a protocol for this odd occurance...  Seems like you should share the ribbon if you both qualififed.   The scores are calculated to more decimal places than the 4 they show us, and that''s how ties are broken. Lovely shot, truly unusual object. Personally, I''d have thought this *should* be a ribbon, but... ETA: Wowza! An honest-to-God ribbon tie! Congrats!', '2009-06-08 13:22:02.000000', '2009-06-09 01:01:17.000000', 0),
