(5520208, 795492, 39427, '<td valign="top">congrats on your first ribbon, and a blue no-less.  Really cool low light shot and a nice moment you''ve captured.</td>', 'congrats on your first ribbon, and a blue no-less.  Really cool low light shot and a nice moment you''ve captured.', '2009-06-08 15:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520209, 794450, 39427, '<td valign="top">now that is something... pretty bad ass, congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'now that is something... pretty bad ass, congrats on the ribbon', '2009-06-08 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520220, 795607, 68504, '<td valign="top">Totally torn between liking the improbable pastel of the improbable and the total wit of the title.</td>', 'Totally torn between liking the improbable pastel of the improbable and the total wit of the title.', '2009-06-08 15:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520245, 795177, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your star, Deb. I love the cool, glass, steel look here. It looks like an unusual and interesting place.</td>', 'Congrats on your star, Deb. I love the cool, glass, steel look here. It looks like an unusual and interesting place.', '2009-06-08 15:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520268, 795177, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am so happy to see that this was yours.  I absolutely loved this one during voting.  Seems you still have your mojo.</td>', 'I am so happy to see that this was yours.  I absolutely loved this one during voting.  Seems you still have your mojo.', '2009-06-08 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520350, 795474, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sculpture and a nice angle and crop to show off the detail well.  Definitely falls into the unusual category.  I like that you included a shot of the full sculpture and the info as well - one of the things I do like a lot about DPC is seeing other parts of the world and the interesting things there.</td>', 'Beautiful sculpture and a nice angle and crop to show off the detail well.  Definitely falls into the unusual category.  I like that you included a shot of the full sculpture and the info as well - one of the things I do like a lot about DPC is seeing other parts of the world and the interesting things there.', '2009-06-08 16:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520353, 795185, 30982, '<td valign="top">He definitely has an unusual pose going!  He almost looks like he''s lit from underneath - those front feathers are almost glowing, which is really quite striking.  I suspect scorewise folks didn''t think a bird was all that unusual of an object.</td>', 'He definitely has an unusual pose going!  He almost looks like he''s lit from underneath - those front feathers are almost glowing, which is really quite striking.  I suspect scorewise folks didn''t think a bird was all that unusual of an object.', '2009-06-08 16:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520356, 795395, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not something most of us see everyday!  I still don''t understand how it would work, but I''ll take your word for it.  :-)</td>', 'Not something most of us see everyday!  I still don''t understand how it would work, but I''ll take your word for it.  :-)', '2009-06-08 16:51:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520359, 795549, 30982, '<td valign="top">Punk?  Nah.  This is a very, very old soul in repose, taking in his afternoon''s ration of sunlight and quite enjoying his day!</td>', 'Punk?  Nah.  This is a very, very old soul in repose, taking in his afternoon''s ration of sunlight and quite enjoying his day!', '2009-06-08 16:52:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520361, 795415, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like finds like this.  Composition is simple and balanced and shows off the object nicely.  The light on the object behind might be seen as distracting by some.</td>', 'I like finds like this.  Composition is simple and balanced and shows off the object nicely.  The light on the object behind might be seen as distracting by some.', '2009-06-08 16:54:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520367, 795607, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  I''m quite sure many never even noticed the lighthouse, despite the major clue in the title.  Sigh.  Kids these days...  Or perhaps lighthouses do indeed abound throughout the world atop buildings and you and I are the only ones to have not noticed.  Which brings me to an ongoing dicussion we''ve been having at my place of employment about the rapture - how would we even know if only 144,000 go?  We''d be clueless... Unless...unless there was a lighthouse atop a building that would send a signal!  Yes!  That''s it!  You''ve solved the mystery!  (And no, I haven''t had my meds today - why do you ask?)</td>', 'LOL!!  I''m quite sure many never even noticed the lighthouse, despite the major clue in the title.  Sigh.  Kids these days...  Or perhaps lighthouses do indeed abound throughout the world atop buildings and you and I are the only ones to have not noticed.  Which brings me to an ongoing dicussion we''ve been having at my place of employment about the rapture - how would we even know if only 144,000 go?  We''d be clueless... Unless...unless there was a lighthouse atop a building that would send a signal!  Yes!  That''s it!  You''ve solved the mystery!  (And no, I haven''t had my meds today - why do you ask?)', '2009-06-08 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520368, 794407, 30982, '<td valign="top">OMG, the story behind this one is priceless!  And I did indeed find it amusing during voting.  Beyond the humor, the detail is excellent - what gorgeous birds they are, even if some of ''em come without heads.</td>', 'OMG, the story behind this one is priceless!  And I did indeed find it amusing during voting.  Beyond the humor, the detail is excellent - what gorgeous birds they are, even if some of ''em come without heads.', '2009-06-08 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520380, 794552, 30982, '<td valign="top">A skiff where you live is, by gosh, VERY unusual.... :-)  That said, excellent perspective and nicely understated color tones.</td>', 'A skiff where you live is, by gosh, VERY unusual.... :-)  That said, excellent perspective and nicely understated color tones.', '2009-06-08 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520382, 794390, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and unusual object and the way you photographed it really suits the character of the item well.  Is that "fade to beard" I see?  :-)</td>', 'A very interesting and unusual object and the way you photographed it really suits the character of the item well.  Is that "fade to beard" I see?  :-)', '2009-06-08 17:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520384, 795072, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this a very interesting object - and in fact want to know if it does indeed feel like paper, or just looks like it?  What a marvelous piece of parchment it would make.</td>', 'I thought this a very interesting object - and in fact want to know if it does indeed feel like paper, or just looks like it?  What a marvelous piece of parchment it would make.', '2009-06-08 17:11:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520385, 794829, 30982, '<td valign="top">I want one!  What an adorable idea for a planter and the perfect plant for it.  For a higher score (heh), use a simpler background (though I think it works fine the way it is.)</td>', 'I want one!  What an adorable idea for a planter and the perfect plant for it.  For a higher score (heh), use a simpler background (though I think it works fine the way it is.)', '2009-06-08 17:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520406, 794377, 96530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a fine image and your first ribbon too Lanndon.</td>', 'Congrats on a fine image and your first ribbon too Lanndon.', '2009-06-08 17:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520450, 794974, 30982, '<td valign="top">So this really is a two-headed turtle, then?  Does this occur often with this type of turtle?</td>', 'So this really is a two-headed turtle, then?  Does this occur often with this type of turtle?', '2009-06-08 18:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520515, 795177, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the star shot  Deb!!!<br/> <br/>This is a fine example of how great composition will allow a photograph to hold our eye.<br/> <br/>I love the way the tower guides my eye through the shot<br/> <br/>Well done and once again congrats on a high finish</td>', 'Congrats on the star shot  Deb!!! This is a fine example of how great composition will allow a photograph to hold our eye. I love the way the tower guides my eye through the shot Well done and once again congrats on a high finish', '2009-06-08 19:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520526, 795556, 86447, '<td valign="top">The DOF and sharpness and processing are all spot on I think, Mike.<br/> <br/>Perhaps this would have scored more highly if it had been taken from the side.  NOT an easy thing to do, change positions and not have them fly away, I know, but maybe it would have helped the body stand out more from the background if it were against the green instead of the brown?  <br/> <br/>I like it, regardless.  The wings are very detailed.</td>', 'The DOF and sharpness and processing are all spot on I think, Mike. Perhaps this would have scored more highly if it had been taken from the side.  NOT an easy thing to do, change positions and not have them fly away, I know, but maybe it would have helped the body stand out more from the background if it were against the green instead of the brown?   I like it, regardless.  The wings are very detailed.', '2009-06-08 19:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520767, 795068, 48228, '<td valign="top">So pleased that they gave you a ribbon as a tie as you so deserved it..... Well done mate</td>', 'So pleased that they gave you a ribbon as a tie as you so deserved it..... Well done mate', '2009-06-08 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5520798, 795177, 33352, '<td valign="top">Another master piece, and a top 5 you are on a roll, congratulations, I really like the perspective of the glass tower in the middle.</td>', 'Another master piece, and a top 5 you are on a roll, congratulations, I really like the perspective of the glass tower in the middle.', '2009-06-08 23:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
