(5521247, 795068, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, that is so awesome!  Congratulations on your ribbon!   I love it that they gave 4 ribbons.   One time, my 4th place score had an exact score for the first 4 decimals as the 3rd place ribbon winner, but it stayed in 4th place because out there even further mine fell below.   So this makes me really happy that they did this. <br/> <br/>And WOW!  What a photo! Deserving of a ribbon for SURE!  It''s FABULOUS!</td>', 'Oh, that is so awesome!  Congratulations on your ribbon!   I love it that they gave 4 ribbons.   One time, my 4th place score had an exact score for the first 4 decimals as the 3rd place ribbon winner, but it stayed in 4th place because out there even further mine fell below.   So this makes me really happy that they did this.  And WOW!  What a photo! Deserving of a ribbon for SURE!  It''s FABULOUS!', '2009-06-09 10:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
