(5522805, 795510, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Well you were pretty bang on the money with you prediction.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would likely have given it a 6.  I am not sure why did not score higher than you did.  The image is well composed and the technicals are fine apart from the blown out bit in the middle.<br/> <br/>I am wondering if this was just not that unusual?</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Well you were pretty bang on the money with you prediction. I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would likely have given it a 6.  I am not sure why did not score higher than you did.  The image is well composed and the technicals are fine apart from the blown out bit in the middle. I am wondering if this was just not that unusual?', '2009-06-10 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
