(5526771, 795161, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nope, DOF is not too shallow.  I thought this worked very well, both as a photograph on its own and for the challenge.  Quite a smile-generating picture in my opinion.  The low voters are probably of the mind that "toys" aren''t good for challenges.  Or they all have this particular toy and therefore don''t find it a bit unusual.  Sorry I can''t be of help on this one.</td>', 'Nope, DOF is not too shallow.  I thought this worked very well, both as a photograph on its own and for the challenge.  Quite a smile-generating picture in my opinion.  The low voters are probably of the mind that "toys" aren''t good for challenges.  Or they all have this particular toy and therefore don''t find it a bit unusual.  Sorry I can''t be of help on this one.', '2009-06-13 17:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5526776, 795161, 53964, '<td valign="top">All I can guess is that too many didn''t know what was unusual about it? *shrug* I like it.<br/>(I have the reindeer) :)</td>', 'All I can guess is that too many didn''t know what was unusual about it? *shrug* I like it.(I have the reindeer) :)', '2009-06-13 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5526779, 795161, 103142, '<td valign="top">I actually liked the shot, but I didn''t know about the pooping part, so I couldn''t figure out what the brown blob was, and it distracted from the photo. I gave it a 6. If you would have simply named it pooping pig candy dispenser, it probably would have gotten a 7 or 8 (i really liked the pig, but like I said, the OOF brown blob didn''t add much when you didn''t know what it was)</td>', 'I actually liked the shot, but I didn''t know about the pooping part, so I couldn''t figure out what the brown blob was, and it distracted from the photo. I gave it a 6. If you would have simply named it pooping pig candy dispenser, it probably would have gotten a 7 or 8 (i really liked the pig, but like I said, the OOF brown blob didn''t add much when you didn''t know what it was)', '2009-06-13 17:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5526787, 795161, 90414, '<td valign="top">I think most of the commenters knew what this was, and scored highly. For many others, it might have been an inside-joke of sorts: if they didn''t recognize it as a humorous candy dispenser, then the "unique object" is a knick-knack and a piece of poo... for which a 5 is a reasonably good score.</td>', 'I think most of the commenters knew what this was, and scored highly. For many others, it might have been an inside-joke of sorts: if they didn''t recognize it as a humorous candy dispenser, then the "unique object" is a knick-knack and a piece of poo... for which a 5 is a reasonably good score.', '2009-06-13 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5527342, 794377, 51269, '<td valign="top">Stunning- congratulations !</td>', 'Stunning- congratulations !', '2009-06-14 10:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5527875, 795177, 53147, '<td valign="top">And an honorable mention over here. Lovely work Deb.</td>', 'And an honorable mention over here. Lovely work Deb.', '2009-06-14 19:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5528205, 795068, 48451, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Brent! Congrats!</td>', 'Great shot, Brent! Congrats!', '2009-06-14 23:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5528985, 795508, 81530, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I remember learning about these in art history.</td>', 'Cool shot. I remember learning about these in art history.', '2009-06-15 10:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5532861, 795161, 96721, '<td valign="top">I really like the humour and would have found it hard to give this shot less than 5 simply for the smile.<br/> <br/>Technically I think the pink cast might have cost you some points, I think possibly desaturating it some might have helped with this.</td>', 'I really like the humour and would have found it hard to give this shot less than 5 simply for the smile. Technically I think the pink cast might have cost you some points, I think possibly desaturating it some might have helped with this.', '2009-06-17 09:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5532876, 795161, 30049, '<td valign="top">Steve - I didn''t vote this challenge and honestly hadn''t even looked thru the entries...<br/> <br/>At first glance this photo made me smile - it''s infectious I guess.  :-P<br/> <br/>Regarding the pig being a candy dispenser?  I had no idea and thought it was a piggy bank.  The "poop" in the background looks too large and round IMO to simulate the real thing, and may have more impact a bit closer to the pig (but then you''d throw the balance off a little I suppose).<br/> <br/>In the end, too much thinking required for some to grasp the concept in the hurry thru and vote mentality.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)</td>', 'Steve - I didn''t vote this challenge and honestly hadn''t even looked thru the entries... At first glance this photo made me smile - it''s infectious I guess.  :-P Regarding the pig being a candy dispenser?  I had no idea and thought it was a piggy bank.  The "poop" in the background looks too large and round IMO to simulate the real thing, and may have more impact a bit closer to the pig (but then you''d throw the balance off a little I suppose). In the end, too much thinking required for some to grasp the concept in the hurry thru and vote mentality. All JMO of course.  :-)', '2009-06-17 09:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5532922, 795161, 67697, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh (I love that face!) and I gave it a 6.  I think I didn''t give it a higher score because it didn''t seem all that unusual to me - but definitely funny!  I think the composition was fine for this.</td>', 'This made me laugh (I love that face!) and I gave it a 6.  I think I didn''t give it a higher score because it didn''t seem all that unusual to me - but definitely funny!  I think the composition was fine for this.', '2009-06-17 09:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5532926, 795161, 83313, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the feedback. It seems that many did not understand what was unusual about the object. I guess I should have used a title that simply described that it as a "Pooping pig candy dispenser", but I hate using deadpan titles like that.</td>', 'Thanks for all the feedback. It seems that many did not understand what was unusual about the object. I guess I should have used a title that simply described that it as a "Pooping pig candy dispenser", but I hate using deadpan titles like that.', '2009-06-17 09:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5534236, 795539, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is a vintage tugboat - I don''t know how old. The bumper on the bow does seem unusual - old truck tires being more the norm.</td>', 'This is a vintage tugboat - I don''t know how old. The bumper on the bow does seem unusual - old truck tires being more the norm.', '2009-06-17 23:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5535534, 795500, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m getting one put in my left knee next week. <br/>I played with it in the doctor''s office - this one doesn''t look like it twists and turns as much as the one he showed me..<br/>Oh, and by the way, I think they''re very unusual. Good shot.</td>', 'I''m getting one put in my left knee next week. I played with it in the doctor''s office - this one doesn''t look like it twists and turns as much as the one he showed me..Oh, and by the way, I think they''re very unusual. Good shot.', '2009-06-18 19:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
